  {
   "id": "jitsu-squad-145440@post-2022-06-22",
   "gameId": "jitsu-squad-145440",
   "displayName": "Countdown for item pickup, Screen Flash (On/Off), Johnny Gioeli song and more!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2022-06-22T18:29:43.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone! We've released a new update which has some balancing and bug fixes done for Jitsu Squad. We are also working hard on the new features as well, we will release some footage of that soon!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here is a list of the changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Bug Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rare crash when Jazz grabs a Ghoul head has been fixed.: Balancing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players can now grab each other in the sushi bonus stages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Time in fury mode after doing a fury burst has been increased.: Polish",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added an option to disable full screen flashes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added subtitles to cutscenes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "A timer has been added at the end of stages to allow you to grab pickups before advancing to the next stage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some spelling mistakes in the movelist.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased pickup range of items. This makes it easier to collect/activate them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Scrolls don't spawn when your character does not need them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some enemies that popped into screen out of nowhere.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added Crush 40's Johnny Gioeli's vocals to the intro screen!🤘: We also have a great favour to ask the Jitsu Squad community: For our visibility to improve on Steam, we need more reviews, we need your voices!: Let the world know that you want more games like this & we'll keep making them!: Thank you so much for your support.: ---: Tanuki Creative Studio 🦝",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
